{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07628","headline":"奉和圣制送张尚书巡边 · 王翰","name":"奉和圣制送张尚书巡边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫绶尚书印，朱軿丞相车。\n登朝身许国，出阃将辞家。\n不惮炎蒸苦，亲尝走集赊。\n选徒军有政，誓卒尔无譁。\n帝乐风初起，王城日半斜。\n宠行流圣作，寅饯照台华。\n骑历河南树，旌摇塞北沙。\n荣怀应尽服，严杀已先加。\n业峻灵只保，功成道路嗟。\n宁如凿空使，远致石榴花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07628.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07628","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}